    "chunk_text": "and se ele geswac \u00f0\u00e6re fledinge; Sume d\u00e6ge eode se halga wer to cyrcan.and gemette \u00feone deofol.and befran hwider he wolde; Se deofol cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde beran drincan his gebro\u00f0rum; Se halga wer \u00f0a hine ardlice geb\u00e6d.and gecyrde ongean.and efne \u00f0a se awyrigeda gast gemette Se eadiga benedictus \u00fea sloh \u00f0one munuc under \u00fe\u00e6t wencge.mid anre handa.and se fula deofol Sum gedwolman \u00f0e salla hatte.ehte cristenra manna on \u00f0am timan mid orm\u00e6tre re\u00f0nysse.swa He \u00f0a \u00e6t sumon s\u00e6le gel\u00e6hte \u00e6nne cristenne mannan.and hine mid mislicum tintregum Se cristena man \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0.\u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6fde his \u00f0ing and hine sylfne bet\u00e6ht \u00feam halgan were Se w\u00e6lhreowa ehtere thesalla \u00fea geswac \u00f0\u00e6ra tintregena.and geband hine mid strangum bendum. Hi \u00f0a becomon to \u00f0\u00e6s mynstres geate \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres.and hine gemetton \u00e6t his r\u00e6dinge sitton; \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se w\u00e6lhreowa \u00feesalla mid micelre re\u00f0nysse to \u00f0am halgan were; Aris.aris.and agif \u00f0ises ceorles yddysce; \u00d0a beseah se halga wer wi\u00f0 his clypunge.and beheold \u00f0one gebundenan mann.and his bendas Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a thesalla \u00f0urh \u00f0as micclan mihte wear\u00f0 afyrht.",
